    {
      "displayText": "I wanna battle to see whose Pikachu is strongest!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf you’re gonna take me on, you can’t have any\nPokémon besides one Pikachu, OK?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
