    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, I get why you’d back out. It’s only natural to\nbe scared of a Pikachu with a Light Ball!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
